We render the screen from your app’s first route. In the reference consumer that route is app/index.tsx (expo-router), and each engine’s thin entrypoint does exactly one thing: import the shared screen and render it. You should see no other logic in the file you paste.
nativewinduniwindimport { QuickstartScreen } from '@/shared/quickstart-screen';

/**
 * The nativewind consumer's thin entrypoint — the seed-data chat screen, nothing else.
 * Root providers, NAV_THEME, and PortalHost live in app/_layout.tsx (ORI-RN-001); this
 * route only renders the shared screen so both engines consume the identical source.
 */
export default function QuickstartIndex() {
  return <QuickstartScreen />;
}
